invalid type: string "Telecom Network Troubleshooting Guide\nBGP Session Troubleshooting:\n1. Check BGP neighbor status\n2. Verify AS numbers\n3. Check keepalive timers\nONT LOS Indicator:\nA blinking LOS (Loss of Signal) indicator on an ONT typically indicates no optical signal received from the O\nTroubleshooting steps:\n1. Check fiber connection\n2. Clean fiber connectors\nck optical power leve